  "title": "Zesty Garlicky Saudi Arabian Lamb Pilaf",
  "description": "A flavorful and aromatic one-pot dish featuring lamb, garlic, and frozen peas, cooked to perfection on a tava griddle. This gluten-free friendly recipe is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
