  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil on the tava griddle over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the basmati rice and stir to combine with the lamb and spices.",
    "Add the frozen peas and stir to combine.",
    "Roll out the laminated puff pastry to a large sheet and place on top of the rice mixture.",
    "Cook for 10 minutes until the pastry is golden brown and the rice is cooked.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
